      "writtenOn": "2026-04-23T23:53:56Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think this is correct. The implicit dependency is on the stamp or phony, which has the correct order-only dependencies. So the path from the target to the dependency still has an order-only edge, but now it\u0027s between the stamp/phony and the dependency instead of between the target and the stamp/phony.",
